E" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources> </patcit><patcit ucid="JP-8148556-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>8148556</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id> <sources><source category="Y"  name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources> </patcit> <patcit ucid="JP-9055431-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9055431</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-9172068-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9172068</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-9172079-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9172079</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-9237834-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9237834</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>TOSHIAKI KAWANE: 'Application of etching organic film in low-k film to Cu Damascene: conquering heat-resistance and O2 plasma resistance (in Japanese)' MONTHLY SEMICONDUCTOR WORLD, NOVEMBER 1998 (KABUSHIKI KAISHA PRESS JOURNAL) vol. 17, no. 12, 20 October 1998, pages 74 - 76, XP002929904</text><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIZUKA SHUICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKYO ELECTRON LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIZUKA, SHUICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKYO ELECTRON LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIZUKA SHUICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIZUKA, SHUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A wiring layer (34) where wiring lines (35) and recesses (30) between adjacent wiring lines (35) are formed is provided on a first interlayer insulating film (41). A second interlayer insulating film (43) being a CF film made of a filming material such as CF which has poor burying properties is provided on the wiring layer (34). An example of a gas for producing the material is C6F6 gas. A plasma is produced from the gas and the CF film is formed on the wiring layer (34) while preventing any CF film from being buried in the recesses (30). Thus, air gaps (36) each having a shape along the recesses (30) are formed between the wiring lines (35). Such a semiconductor device has a reduced capacitance between wiring lines while the mechanical stress is hardly weakened.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une couche de câblage (34) dans laquelle sont formées des lignes de câblage (35) et des cavités (30) entre les lignes de câblage adjacentes (35), cette couche de câblage (34) étant établie sur un premier film d'isolation intercouches (41). Un second film d'isolation intercouches (43) à base de carbone et de fluor, par exemple, ayant de faibles propriétés d'enfouissement, est établi sur la couche de câblage (34). On peut utiliser du gaz C6F6 comme gaz pour la production du matériau constituant le film. Un plasma est réalisé à partir du gaz, et le film à base de carbone et de fluor est constitué sur la couche de câblage (34). Simultanément, on empêche l'enfouissement dudit film dans les cavités (30). Ainsi, des poches d'air (36) ayant chacune une forme établie le long des cavités (30) sont constituées entre les lignes de câblage (35). Le type de dispositif à semiconducteur considéré présente une capacité réduite entre les lignes de câblage, tandis que la contrainte mécanique est à peine réduite.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>